      "id": 1,
      "text": "Sewoon Sangga, a historic shopping complex completed in 1970, still buzzes with tech vendors and retro cafés in Seongdong-gu.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
