      "source": "https://travel.mostinfo.kr/entry/Where-Past-and-Present-Coexist-Discover-Seongdong-gu",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Euljiro area of Seongdong-gu blends vintage shops passed down through generations with hip cafés and art galleries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://travel.mostinfo.kr/entry/Where-Past-and-Present-Coexist-Discover-Seongdong-gu",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Seongdong-gu sits on Seoul’s north bank of the Han River, anchoring the city’s historic core while embracing modern culture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seongdong_District",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Seongdong-gu’s history stretches back over 1,500 years, making it one of Seoul’s oldest districts with a rich cultural tapestry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://travel.mostinfo.kr/entry/Where-Past-and-Present-Coexist-Discover-Seongdong-gu",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Known for its vibrant street life, Seongdong-gu’s vendors and performers celebrate the district’s historical roots every day.",
